      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming and considerate veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise Dr Biggs, Dr Johnson, and their front desk team for their friendly reception and attentive care. Reviewers frequently note that nurses handle nervous or muzzled dogs with notable patience and empathy during visits. While two clients reported disputes with receptionists over booking policies, the majority praise the clinical team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed feedback on practice communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several clients appreciate thorough discussions regarding pet diagnoses, allergy treatments, and routine puppy care. However, other reviewers express frustration with unannounced medication additions on bills, cancelled follow-ups, and difficulties obtaining prescription refills. Pet owners recommend confirming medication protocols during consultations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight how comfortably their cats and dogs are treated throughout check-ups, vaccine visits, and ear treatments. Pet parents appreciate that staff soothe anxious animals and work calmly around sensitive pets. Reviewers describe finding reassurance in the considerate manner clinicians show when caring for long-term family companions."
      }
    }
  ],
